The app images and partition tables in packages/engine/tests/circuits/esp32s3-hello/blobs, packages/engine/tests/circuits/esp32s3-screen/blobs,
packages/engine/tests/circuits/esp32s3-encoder/blobs, packages/engine/tests/circuits/esp32s3-touch/blobs, packages/engine/tests/circuits/esp32s3-dualcore/blobs and
packages/engine/tests/circuits/esp32s3-echo/blobs are built from this directory by packages/engine/scripts/esp32s3-firmware.sh
with ESP-IDF v5.5.5, the tag v5.5.5 of https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf, and its toolchain
esp-14.2.0_20260121. Their source is not kept in this repository, and that tag and toolchain give
it. The screen app also links three components from the ESP Component Registry,
https://components.espressif.com, at the versions and hashes screen/dependencies.lock pins:
lvgl/lvgl 9.3.0, espressif/esp_lcd_st77916 2.0.2, and espressif/cmake_utilities 0.5.3, which only
the build uses.

